# Smart Agriculture Disease Doctor

## Objective
AI web app to detect crop diseases from leaf images and give treatment suggestions in Telugu.

## Tech Stack
Python, TensorFlow, Keras, MobileNetV2, Streamlit

## Dataset  
PlantVillage Dataset - 38 Classes

## Day 1 Progress
- Project topic finalized
- GitHub repository created  
- Research completed
- PPT prepared

## Next Steps
Day 2-3: Dataset download and model training
